blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"On 2019-12-16, I found a cause for several occasional test failures on `PgMiniTest`: `MiniCluster::RestartSync`.  `PgMiniTest.BulkCopyWithRestart` and `PgMiniTest.DropDB*` encounter this.  A key message I found is\r\n\r\n```\r\nE1214 04:05:16.640359 23514 async_initializer.cc:83] Failed to initialize client: Invalid argument (yb/client/client-internal.cc:1431): Could not locate the leader master: No master address specified by '' (all master server addresses: [])\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe message\r\n\r\n```\r\n2019-12-14 04:04:25.798 UTC [22576] FATAL:  the database system is starting up\r\n```\r\n\r\nseems to be a red herring as I got tests to pass while having it.","closed_by":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3336/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}